[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS021
TITLE: Keep the checked envelope when a training profile is larger
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall keep the checked envelope at 4 runways, 8 aircraft, and 2 neighbors. Training scenarios shall use a separate limit set. The checked startup path shall still refuse a picture outside 4, 8, and 2. Acceptance is a checked refusal of 9 aircraft and a training run of more than 8 aircraft that leaves the checked limits unchanged.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Denver-scale training must not be loaded as if TLC had checked it.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. The TLA+ model stays on that envelope.
